    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwe bena Galatia muli mpelwamano! Nani uwamufulungenye? Nalimulondolwela bwino no kumulangafye bwino ifyo Kristu atanikwe pa musalaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalamwipushafye icintu cimo, bushe mwapokele Mupashi Wamushilo ico mwalesunga Amafunde yakwa Mose, nangu nico mwaumfwile no kusumina Imbila Nsuma? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe cine kupelwamano konse uko! Mwatampile na Mupashi wakwa Lesa, nomba mulefwaya ukupwishishisha na maka yenu ayabuntunse? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe ninshi fyonse ifyo mwaculileko fyali fyafye? Nshilesubila ukuti fyali fyafye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico Lesa amupeelela Mupashi no kulacita ifipeshamano uko muli, bushe nico musunga Amafunde yakwa Mose nangu nico mumfwa Imbila Nsuma elyo no kusumina mwasumina?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
